cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Trust & Safety Sentry"
abstract: >-
  A governed agentic workbench for Trust & Safety scaled-abuse analysis.
  A small fleet of narrow AI agents performs bounded cognitive work under a
  deterministic control layer, supervised by one human analyst who holds sole
  enforcement authority. Out-of-mandate actions are structurally unexpressible
  rather than blocked at runtime, every agent step is recorded in a hash-chained
  ledger, and all data is synthetic.
type: software
